0420B0             0014*   @dispatch:
0420B0             0015*       CALL_HL
                       M1 Args: none
0420B0 01 B6 20 04 0001*M1     ld bc,$+6 ; Address of first instruction after the jump
0420B4 C5          0002*M1     push bc ; which constitutes the return address
0420B5 E9          0003*M1     jp (hl) ; Jump to the address in HL
0420B6 C9          0016*       ret
