0482DA             0196*   
0482DA             0197*   ; gets the next available sprite id for a particular sprite group
0482DA             0198*   ; inputs; ix = pointer to sprite group, b = number of records in sprite group
0482DA             0199*   ; returns: if new sprite available, a = sprite id, ix pointing to new sprite vars, carry set
